    "slide.connections": { "source": "Connections", "target": "关系", "status": "reviewed" },
    "slide.connectionsHint": { "source": "Use the Hero, Faction, and NPC blocks. In each block, + Add adds a row: This entry (you), relationship lines in the middle, and one linked name (autocomplete for that type only). Choose A (left) or B (right) for this entry on the slide; the linked side uses the other letter. Legacy rows without a letter default to A. Saving mirrors onto the linked row in this same archive when that row exists; cross-archive links are not duplicated.", "target": "使用英雄、阵营和 NPC 区块。每个区块中，点击“+ 添加”新增一行：本条目（你）、中间的关系描述，以及一个关联名称（仅补全对应类型）。在幻灯片中为本条目选择 A（左）或 B（右）；关联一侧会使用另一个字母。没有字母的旧行默认为 A。如果同一档案中存在关联行，保存时会同步写入；跨档案关联不会重复创建。", "status": "reviewed" },
